      </div>
      <div class="corner-card">
        <div class="corner-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="corner-label">C3</div>
        <div class="corner-title">Receiver's Access Point</div>
        <p class="corner-desc">The receiver's Access Point retrieves the document. For cross-border trades, the SMP/SML routing layer handles discovery and delivery.</p>
