      <div class="corner-card">
        <div class="corner-label">C4</div>
        <div class="corner-title">Receiver</div>
        <p class="corner-desc">The buyer receives the structured invoice directly into their ERP or accounting system — no email, no PDF re-keying, complete audit trail.</p>
